:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The balance of the unrecognized tax benefits and related interest was <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_-q6KwND1tUyIErqFk9amwg" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2025_Ddj8avuNXUekqecrPRoVuw" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefitsIncomeTaxPenaltiesAndInterestAccrued" scale="0" id="Narr_efe1J7GjKUicwYnV6-hBnQ">zero</ix:nonFraction> on October 31, 2025 because all previous balances <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_11_1_2024_To_10_31_2025_yHj0kCho6kqyjsmbpqPtIg" name="hurc:UnrecognizedTaxBenefitsExpirationTerm" id="Narr_bd6ANQ8fmE66jBQmVeXM0w">expired as of August 2025</ix:nonNumeric> due to the statute of limitations with respect to unrecognized tax benefits.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;">We file U.S. federal and state income tax returns, as well as tax returns in applicable foreign jurisdictions. </span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="color:#ff0000;font-size:11pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;">A summary of open tax years by major jurisdiction is presented below:</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_11_1_2024_To_10_31_2025_yHj0kCho6kqyjsmbpqPtIg" name="us-gaap:SummaryOfIncomeTaxContingenciesTextBlock" id="Tb_lovlu98rDkChV8k9mNxWEA" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:48.55%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.88%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:48.55%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:48.55%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;">United States federal</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.88%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:48.55%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_11_1_2024_To_10_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_us-gaap_InternalRevenueServiceIRSMember_IfEcDRvxZ0uwVJexn-4fxw" name="hurc:OpenTaxYears" id="Tc_UIzzZixm6kWOx-axYVnTiA_1_2">Fiscal 2022 through the current period</ix:nonNumeric></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:48.55%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;">Germany&#185;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.88%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:48.55%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_11_1_2024_To_10_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_country_DE_mnHcsdJUfEKlRoXNP04mFQ" name="hurc:OpenTaxYears" id="Tc_F935sZEjF0CiG_BurJUGqw_2_2">Fiscal 2022 through the current period</ix:nonNumeric></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:48.55%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;">Taiwan</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.88%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:48.55%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_11_1_2024_To_10_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_country_TW_yENKOSo1dE6FalVYGGIkEw" name="hurc:OpenTaxYears" id="Tc_v5KiyFnpykybdebkdEgLXA_3_2">Fiscal 2020 through the current period</ix:nonNumeric></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:48.55%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;">United Kingdom</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.88%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:48.55%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_11_1_2024_To_10_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_country_GB_866Kh8yn9E258GmffJy2XQ" name="hurc:OpenTaxYears" id="Tc_2Hhft9DMp0GH4ltqBc41PQ_4_2">Fiscal 2019 through the current period</ix:nonNumeric></p></td></tr></table><div style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10.0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;min-height:1.19em;position:relative;width:100%;"><div style="background-color:#000000;height:1pt;position:relative;top:0.6em;width:25.0%;border:none;margin:0 auto 0 0;"></div></div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">&#185;</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;"><ix:footnote xml:lang="en-US" id="_c2720422_d0d6_462a_a501_7fd6bbe51cc5"><span style="font-size:10pt;">Includes federal as well as state, provincial or similar local jurisdictions, as applicable.</span></ix:footnote></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_11_1_2024_To_10_31_2025_yHj0kCho6kqyjsmbpqPtIg" name="us-gaap:PensionAndOtherPostretirementBenefitsDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_MWt2ozqCXUSGeHkBdA3Mzw" continuedAt="Tb_MWt2ozqCXUSGeHkBdA3Mzw_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;">7.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;EMPLOYEE BENEFITS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;">We have defined contribution plans that include a majority of our U.S. employees, under which our matching contributions are primarily discretionary. The purpose of these plans is generally to provide additional financial security during retirement by providing employees with an incentive to save throughout their employment. Our contributions and related expense totaled </span><span style="font-size:11pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_-q6KwND1tUyIErqFk9amwg" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2024_To_10_31_2025_yHj0kCho6kqyjsmbpqPtIg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanEmployerDiscretionaryContributionAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_TQVFCXfmuk-uyLOAnsLzJA">1.2</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> million, </span><span style="font-size:11pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_-q6KwND1tUyIErqFk9amwg" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2023_To_10_31_2024_AzgqyTUqgU6C1t8FzQk9uQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanEmployerDiscretionaryContributionAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_fv_yX0HxLkqb-JEgl856Sg">1.2</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> million, and </span><span style="font-size:11pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_-q6KwND1tUyIErqFk9amwg" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2022_To_10_31_2023_0eliLWfPpUubNtjuxa3G2w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanEmployerDiscretionaryContributionAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_O89Bw-SZrEuOwYFBQSLyaQ">1.4</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> million, for the fiscal&#160;years ended October 31, 2025, 2024, and 2023, respectively.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">72</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_MWt2ozqCXUSGeHkBdA3Mzw_cont1"></ix:continuation><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_11_1_2024_To_10_31_2025_yHj0kCho6kqyjsmbpqPtIg" name="us-gaap:DisclosureOfCompensationRelatedCostsShareBasedPaymentsTextBlock" id="Tb_i2P-L-5RZU2yVtoCScsv1w" continuedAt="Tb_i2P-L-5RZU2yVtoCScsv1w_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;">8</b><b style="font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;">.</b><span style="font-size:11pt;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><b style="font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;">STOCK&#8211;BASED COMPENSATION</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;">In March 2016, we adopted the Hurco Companies, Inc. 2016 Equity Incentive Plan (as amended, the &#8220;2016 Equity Plan&#8221;), which allows us to grant awards of stock options, stock appreciation rights, restricted stock, stock units and other stock-based awards. The 2016 Equity Plan replaced the Hurco Companies, Inc. 2008 Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2008 Equity Plan&#8221;) and is the only active plan under which equity awards may be made by us to our employees and non-employee directors. </span><span style="font-size:11pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2024_To_10_31_2025_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_hurc_TwentyZeroEightPlanMember_WQ8svDO7OESs72AdPtKx3g" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_9nsH5jeXGU-Z6d4BViCang">No</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> further awards will be made under our 2008 Equity Plan. The total number of shares of our common stock that may be issued pursuant to awards under the 2016 Equity Plan was initially </span><span style="font-size:11pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_10_2016_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_hurc_TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_Fsp0xfkXm0WkZHbk1Q0xZg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_IPy8_Dw2tkKP5fC3X9c_Dg">856,048</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;">, which included </span><span style="font-size:11pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_10_2016_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_hurc_TwentyZeroEightPlanMember_Ykd4E6t0ZUGa_7Tw5xulkw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" scale="0" id="Narr_ixwrzlPfC0aTpGHZvmiOIA">386,048</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> shares that remained available for future grants under the 2008 Equity Plan as of March 10, 2016, the date our shareholders approved the 2016 Equity Plan. On March 10, 2022, our shareholders approved the Amended and Restated Hurco Companies, Inc. 2016 Equity Incentive Plan, which, among other items, increased the aggregate number of shares that may be issued under the 2016 Equity Plan by </span><span style="font-size:11pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_3_10_2022_To_3_10_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_hurc_TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_7w1gKybSMkmDSesz2BSABQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_VcuNWM0sIESs5SnkwSZsLA">850,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> shares. On March 13, 2025, our shareholders approved an amendment to the 2016 Equity Plan, which increased the aggregate number of shares that may be issued thereunder by an additional </span><span style="font-size:11pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_3_13_2025_To_3_13_2025_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_hurc_TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_akB2OE-HY02vsU-Lni5MTw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_c4jZdZSpnE-Ro9HWl_u87A">850,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> shares.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;">The Compensation Committee of our Board of Directors has the authority to determine the officers, directors, and key employees who will be granted awards under the 2016 Equity Plan; designate the number of shares subject to each award; determine the terms and conditions upon which awards will be granted; and prescribe the form and terms of award agreements. We have granted restricted shares and performance stock units under the 2016 Equity Plan that are currently outstanding. The market value of a share of our common stock, for purposes of the 2016 Equity Plan, is the closing sale price as reported by the Nasdaq Global Select Market on the date in question or, if not a trading day, on the last preceding trading date.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;">Stock Options</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;">The final </span><span style="font-size:11pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2022_To_10_31_2023_0eliLWfPpUubNtjuxa3G2w" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_bvlNGMgIzUyXob8OeY27yg">11,559</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> shares remaining available under option were exercised during the fiscal year ended October 31, 2023. There were </span><span style="font-size:11pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2024_4SUZ15s_Pkew4pHUZRUPZA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingNumber" scale="0" id="Narr_GkyMYt40RUCpyQwMhe4c6g"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2025_Ddj8avuNXUekqecrPRoVuw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingNumber" scale="0" id="Narr_YwFUkHiG00WDUtAXlTwPoA">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> stock options outstanding as of October 31, 2025 and 2024.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;"><b style="font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;">Time-based Restricted Shares and Performance Stock Units</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">On March 13, 2025, March 14, 2024, and March 9, 2023, the Compensation Committee granted a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_3_13_2025_To_3_13_2025_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_W6mARLpXkE6K26vo6-xhIA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_6QH1DxSfMU-eyj8p694Eqw">29,868</ix:nonFraction> shares, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_3_14_2024_To_3_14_2024_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_XOitONUD-E2s9u_V_V4Tsw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_Fa8l5aEnZ0Oegr92CS6HPA">22,878</ix:nonFraction> shares, and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_3_9_2023_To_3_9_2023_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_-IuYOtVUfEGzGz1acnFznA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_g58Q_MKWekyjuJ2Wbq5VEg">17,226</ix:nonFraction> shares of time-based restricted stock, respectively, to our non-employee directors, which vest in full <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_3_9_2023_To_3_9_2023_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_-IuYOtVUfEGzGz1acnFznA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_MUv6dBjQ3k6-6FEHi77vgw"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_3_14_2024_To_3_14_2024_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_XOitONUD-E2s9u_V_V4Tsw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_5Jalvw1QAk6YMJDQ-CPWeg"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_3_13_2025_To_3_13_2025_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_W6mARLpXkE6K26vo6-xhIA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_TK9L1fWiw0OmUUEhg7lXFw">one year</ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric> from the date of grant provided the recipient remains on the board of directors through that date. The grant date fair values of the restricted shares were based on the closing sales price of our common stock on the grant dates, which were $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_cK0tCHROTEui2Cyp4lJA6w" contextRef="As_Of_3_13_2025_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_c6aJE7cys0Gs3L9xNUerYg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_F_D10H9snUS00Fi1Mk_0YQ">16.07</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_cK0tCHROTEui2Cyp4lJA6w" contextRef="As_Of_3_14_2024_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_yxwgJKo2FkSMFgskxCR0uA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_1lTfN0p7PEOzajU9bslL9w">20.98</ix:nonFraction>, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_cK0tCHROTEui2Cyp4lJA6w" contextRef="As_Of_3_9_2023_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_FUfxNtB8SEilw6a-jTLzyA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr__x7GUYbSU0-cDavSCf8IJQ">27.86</ix:nonFraction> per share, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">On November 13, 2024, November 8, 2023, and November 9, 2022, the Compensation Committee granted a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_11_13_2024_To_11_13_2024_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_836-kaUDJkqa9arm4_26Dw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_RF-IxEPvaEeY0Qb_h3-lPA">13,525</ix:nonFraction> shares, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_11_8_2023_To_11_8_2023_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_IcpuoViZWkaIrbJmxR6jVg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_l5eac76jO0qKlBPuY37pWQ">16,673</ix:nonFraction> shares, and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_11_9_2022_To_11_9_2022_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_v-FUxoGYPUK-40eggaO_jA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_2J0_lSlY6EulTH4MJP9vmQ">12,223</ix:nonFraction> shares of time-based restricted stock, respectively, to our non-executive employees. The restricted shares vest in thirds over <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_11_9_2022_To_11_9_2022_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_v-FUxoGYPUK-40eggaO_jA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_HF9ASKscaUWpbNq_5RHMAQ"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_11_8_2023_To_11_8_2023_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_IcpuoViZWkaIrbJmxR6jVg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_pN1CMawgY0a3S7eWlYmSyw"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_11_13_2024_To_11_13_2024_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_836-kaUDJkqa9arm4_26Dw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_BLPr1sG2UUKYmbmQn9RmpQ">three years</ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric> from the date of grant provided the recipient remains employed through that date. The grant date fair values of the restricted shares were based upon the closing sales price of our common stock on the dates of grant, which were $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_cK0tCHROTEui2Cyp4lJA6w" contextRef="As_Of_11_13_2024_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_JoypKJV9ike3QyjgOA2AFg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_uWwhoNGeP06G3dY0H3AO_A">21.80</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_cK0tCHROTEui2Cyp4lJA6w" contextRef="As_Of_11_8_2023_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_acG58NBNk0e7IDI3DXCBrQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_5vLrr2sqw0u8lRvHb_s0yw">19.78</ix:nonFraction>, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_cK0tCHROTEui2Cyp4lJA6w" contextRef="As_Of_11_9_2022_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_hurc_NonexecutiveEmployeesMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_BzDgLOkgFUmFio5jJxoG5g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_KkN44hqW4kOWPT9yJFCx3g">24.53</ix:nonFraction> per shares, respectively.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">73</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_i2P-L-5RZU2yVtoCScsv1w_cont1" continuedAt="Tb_i2P-L-5RZU2yVtoCScsv1w_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">On January 7, 2025, the Compensation Committee approved a long-term incentive compensation arrangement for our executive officers in the form of time-based restricted shares and performance stock units (&#8220;PSUs&#8221;), which will be payable in shares of our common stock if earned and vested. The awards were approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_7_2025_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_cI23AQTI0U-QhnhAH5DOGQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_VjIovpaw5E6Je-N2RMlcPg">45</ix:nonFraction>% time-based vesting and approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_7_2025_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_33CQsG0GyE6CJWYNmZ-1Jg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_hZ4OnMU5MUugV3iI3LWyXQ">55</ix:nonFraction>% performance-based vesting. The <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_7_2025_To_1_7_2025_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_0EhtKWEyakWr1D67_LO4Tw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_CCtpwubeMEG5ANmRKbrhCg">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> performance period for the PSUs is fiscal year 2025 through fiscal year 2027.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">On that date, the Compensation Committee granted a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_1_7_2025_To_1_7_2025_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_lkQndWbrKUWHNaYRyIgveQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_-Ebn1om_UkO5SvfWJuLYAA">75,119</ix:nonFraction> shares of time-based restricted stock to our executive officers. The restricted shares vest in thirds over <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_7_2025_To_1_7_2025_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_lkQndWbrKUWHNaYRyIgveQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_ClfmOiBgZEidZfal2n0s1Q">three years</ix:nonNumeric> from the date of grant provided the recipient remains employed through that date. The grant date fair value of the restricted shares was based upon the closing sales price of our common stock on the date of grant, which was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_cK0tCHROTEui2Cyp4lJA6w" contextRef="As_Of_1_7_2025_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_cI23AQTI0U-QhnhAH5DOGQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_oUcv41K2x0O-NU18jr_3lg">19.81</ix:nonFraction> per share.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">On January 7, 2025, the Compensation Committee also granted a total target number of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_1_7_2025_To_1_7_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_XM0lG8rIykyuapoP9nDEUQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_Cs9q89E6CEK_Gu5W_FCFtQ">50,078</ix:nonFraction> PSUs to our executive officers designated as &#8220;PSU &#8211; NI&#8221;. These PSUs were weighted as approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_7_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_ahssUn_7WUus1oJPE6nGwA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_WUTj47-cNE2c6zIAHvPo1w">30</ix:nonFraction>% of the overall 2025 executive long-term incentive compensation arrangement and will vest and be paid based upon the achievement of pre-established goals related to our average net income over the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_7_2025_To_1_7_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_C_-7wu1CBEWr9WFEZyBfFA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_8ilhQbY_HEWlZ-UOrbkNjA">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> period of fiscal years 2025-2027. Participants will have the ability to earn between <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_7_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_tK1vg-up3UKNGHIZIyhs5w" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfTargetNumberOfSharesToBeEarned" scale="-2" id="Narr_3GxOlbaIEUWTQfvc3cEbDw">50</ix:nonFraction>% of the target number of the PSUs &#8211; NI for achieving threshold performance and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_7_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_bUTVdTW7REa8OcCKhnHjKQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfTargetNumberOfSharesToBeEarned" scale="-2" id="Narr_ydK4WX0xMkeuTffZhFQL8Q">200</ix:nonFraction>% of the target number of the PSUs &#8211; NI for achieving maximum performance. The grant date fair value of the PSUs &#8211; NI was based on the closing sales price of our common stock on the grant date, which was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_cK0tCHROTEui2Cyp4lJA6w" contextRef="As_Of_1_7_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_ahssUn_7WUus1oJPE6nGwA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_Kvse2q8Q30KQ8A5NeOttIA">19.81</ix:nonFraction> per PSU.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">On January 7, 2025, the Compensation Committee also granted a total target number of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_1_7_2025_To_1_7_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_tkEk1bYz0k-AvCuykVSHIA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_518BX_Eq3UKS0DwChmH-iQ">41,735</ix:nonFraction> PSUs to our executive officers designated as &#8220;PSU &#8211; FCF&#8221;. These PSUs were weighted as approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_7_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_k6Fz7ULUSE-J9zyfWgXbYw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_2KGyCa4ewUy4XzjsOZIXBw">25</ix:nonFraction>% of the overall 2025 executive long-term incentive compensation arrangement and will vest and be paid based upon the achievement of pre-established goals related to our average free cash flow over the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_7_2025_To_1_7_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_tkEk1bYz0k-AvCuykVSHIA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_d5rERwrp20e1xMe4bsv5yA">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> period of fiscal years 2025-2027. Participants will have the ability to earn between <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_7_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_oHsiA0d740aEQeB0_jT9YA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfTargetNumberOfSharesToBeEarned" scale="-2" id="Narr_bqoddJ4hKUGheX3dtssSCw">50</ix:nonFraction>% of the target number of the PSUs &#8211; FCF for achieving threshold performance and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_7_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_h1VJtAn0FUajvdKKfY_zOA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfTargetNumberOfSharesToBeEarned" scale="-2" id="Narr_86NBGDmkbU2wAffF0iGLzw">200</ix:nonFraction>% of the target number of the PSUs &#8211; FCF for achieving maximum performance. The grant date fair value of the PSUs &#8211; FCF was based on the closing sales price of our common stock on the grant date, which was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_cK0tCHROTEui2Cyp4lJA6w" contextRef="As_Of_1_7_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_k6Fz7ULUSE-J9zyfWgXbYw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_y6Dvrx-jhkewvjNu7eSh-Q">19.81</ix:nonFraction> per PSU.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">On January 4, 2024, the Compensation Committee approved a long-term incentive compensation arrangement for our executive officers in the form of time-based restricted shares and PSUs under the 2016 Equity Plan, which will be payable in shares of our common stock if earned and vested. The awards were approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_4_2024_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_5aWRdSA_UUGA5xU1WRQiAw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_AnbGQFdw5kyH6ncBGxgCnQ">25</ix:nonFraction>% time-based vesting and approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_4_2024_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_Pooa6CHrSEywNpL3joMZmQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_WJfB2-Lyj0y4qlKpnoo4CA">75</ix:nonFraction>% performance-based vesting. The <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_4_2024_To_1_4_2024_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_IapZkA3qBUaRM64Mg4N8FQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_KaJwvHagAUaJGEzgF_rzyQ">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> performance period for the PSUs is fiscal year 2024 through fiscal year 2026.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">On that date, the Compensation Committee granted a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_1_4_2024_To_1_4_2024_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_9n3HFsjd70eiV0JogQVbFQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_0i9kXxv-ME-azKPBQyQBFg">36,574</ix:nonFraction> shares of time-based restricted shares to our executive officers. The restricted shares vest in thirds over <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_4_2024_To_1_4_2024_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_9n3HFsjd70eiV0JogQVbFQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_2Bf7Py5u0U26GTZ80oO91g">three years</ix:nonNumeric> from the date of grant provided the recipient remains employed through that date. The grant date fair value of the restricted shares was based upon the closing sales price of our common stock on the date of grant, which was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_cK0tCHROTEui2Cyp4lJA6w" contextRef="As_Of_1_4_2024_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_5aWRdSA_UUGA5xU1WRQiAw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_vJt-Ufkw9k259BDZ6HPwig">21.53</ix:nonFraction> per share.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">On January 4, 2024, the Compensation Committee also granted a total target number of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_1_4_2024_To_1_4_2024_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_5buvlEEE8kyWI-6sj8aOIw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_r6k4sPtBgk2U0Hc0YRDCdg">58,520</ix:nonFraction> PSUs to our executive officers designated as &#8220;PSU &#8211; NI&#8221;. These PSUs were weighted as approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_4_2024_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_B_4JP-5_GEe-cvwiTifjUg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_t5o_B-PG2Uiy3HNQzZ-lxQ">40</ix:nonFraction>% of the overall 2024 executive long-term incentive compensation arrangement and will vest and be paid based upon the achievement of pre-established goals related to our average net income over the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_4_2024_To_1_4_2024_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_5buvlEEE8kyWI-6sj8aOIw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_vSjR8VIgE0KxcGYgMefLGA">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> period of fiscal years 2024-2026. Participants will have the ability to earn between <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_4_2024_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_ggAOwub2PEqB-CrHpVJ9Jg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfTargetNumberOfSharesToBeEarned" scale="-2" id="Narr_q-3sghPxUEmc-iqfv7JsoQ">50</ix:nonFraction>% of the target number of the PSUs &#8211; NI for achieving threshold performance and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_4_2024_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_TwaiLl0OYUSBzEVuewMa3A" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfTargetNumberOfSharesToBeEarned" scale="-2" id="Narr_0iXEvyCffEWgHopsezxrsg">200</ix:nonFraction>% of the target number of the PSUs &#8211; NI for achieving maximum performance. The grant date fair value of the PSUs &#8211; NI was based on the closing sales price of our common stock on the grant date, which was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_cK0tCHROTEui2Cyp4lJA6w" contextRef="As_Of_1_4_2024_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_B_4JP-5_GEe-cvwiTifjUg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="