<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="_19f38c39_d739_4421_aa68_ef2a6f2c8214"></a><a id="Tc_lVxuRq-7702aS1b2tEwRyA_1_4"></a><a id="Tc_I5wpQl6fokyGqGsNla-XPA_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_G5ZXd27aVUGmOoMVLXVPCQ_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_zF62_KC4SUmrs9tn0KCCjw_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_eMfPGGx_rUKcnE3E0ZB_iQ_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_TOnUCF4xZ0yJUZJI8sUU7g_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_Ig7Vo_gNz06y6uJGCzyvrA_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_tLjywV9B50WOjFKb1kEyAQ_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_BDj6qteW30CBrIm8QjJUaA_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_GK3drGJGuEGXNKsVo77SvQ_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_IHidFBCfdU6_M7dRq3pXyw_8_4"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_i2P-L-5RZU2yVtoCScsv1w_cont2" continuedAt="Tb_i2P-L-5RZU2yVtoCScsv1w_cont3"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">On January 4, 2024, the Compensation Committee also granted a total target number of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_1_4_2024_To_1_4_2024_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_LPROybfBLk-VqpYXarHDUg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_en0YeA4kyUaICC---l2u0Q">51,205</ix:nonFraction> PSUs to our executive officers designated as &#8220;PSU &#8211; FCF&#8221;. These PSUs were weighted as approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_4_2024_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_Vg0n8WOjy0uW82CkAiaXEg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_h_4JS77MAUqPU4pUUEhGfw">35</ix:nonFraction>% of the overall 2024 executive long-term incentive compensation arrangement and will vest and be paid based upon the achievement of pre-established goals related to our average free cash flow over the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_4_2024_To_1_4_2024_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_LPROybfBLk-VqpYXarHDUg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_95xI1Gnvl0uXCUz622Cr5Q">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> period of fiscal years 2024-2026. Participants will have the ability to earn between <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_4_2024_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_h12tqrbgfEqE7SvK7fM7IQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfTargetNumberOfSharesToBeEarned" scale="-2" id="Narr_pc7xZ8NL_kG2oCH0yNayww">50</ix:nonFraction>% of the target number of the PSUs &#8211; FCF for achieving threshold performance and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_4_2024_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_hu7BDF_JiUq5zCOD2sUnqA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfTargetNumberOfSharesToBeEarned" scale="-2" id="Narr_6gG-O8cKZU6bloxik_IG8g">200</ix:nonFraction>% of the target number of the PSUs &#8211; FCF for achieving maximum performance. The grant date fair value of the PSUs &#8211; FCF was based on the closing sales price of our common stock on the grant date, which was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_cK0tCHROTEui2Cyp4lJA6w" contextRef="As_Of_1_4_2024_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_Vg0n8WOjy0uW82CkAiaXEg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_p6fkAsxDT0KE2f3X4bzyVw">21.53</ix:nonFraction> per PSU.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">On January 3, 2023, the Compensation Committee approved a long-term incentive compensation arrangement for our executive officers in the form of time-based restricted shares and PSUs under the 2016 Equity Plan, which will be payable in shares of our common stock if earned and vested. The awards were approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_3_2023_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_LhqQbRVKME2QqXGekUJFxQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_bFs7LyDTnkGuPelPCRb7Rw">25</ix:nonFraction>% time-based vesting and approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_3_2023_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_hNMK6NkN00G1AnTeDmbd6Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_gASFZPyBhUqQ80B84Ooimw">75</ix:nonFraction>% performance-based vesting. The <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_3_2023_To_1_3_2023_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_NsWLT5AYOku11tdwnZ1aeQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_Icomi908gUavXBmX4KHHOg">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> performance period for the PSUs is fiscal year 2023 through fiscal year 2025.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">On that date, the Compensation Committee granted a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_1_3_2023_To_1_3_2023_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_G7xTVKbv0EaMfvYr6B-fMw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_bWdPzJHkRUCpnWY6kISbeA">29,376</ix:nonFraction> shares of time-based restricted shares to our executive officers. The restricted shares vest in thirds over <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_3_2023_To_1_3_2023_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_G7xTVKbv0EaMfvYr6B-fMw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_TNXJCfjUHECrlfH0AhRVdg">three years</ix:nonNumeric> from the date of grant provided the recipient remains employed through that date. The grant date fair value of the restricted shares was based upon the closing sales price of our common stock on the date of grant, which was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_cK0tCHROTEui2Cyp4lJA6w" contextRef="As_Of_1_3_2023_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_LhqQbRVKME2QqXGekUJFxQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_pbnEleFgLUS1EyAiAjOmwQ">26.38</ix:nonFraction> per share.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">On January 3, 2023, the Compensation Committee also granted a total target number of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_1_3_2023_To_1_3_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_KRtHCTK-K02DrrF0sMtznw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_k44ccKJt9EufqKrMTdYB1A">47,003</ix:nonFraction> PSUs to our executive officers designated as &#8220;PSU &#8211; NI&#8221;. These PSUs were weighted as approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_3_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_3PmJxYhzW06_SL4V6ao6Ag" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_g0a6GKjRUECiFpMqHGsXWQ">40</ix:nonFraction>% of the overall 2023 executive long-term incentive compensation arrangement and will vest and be paid based upon the achievement of pre-established goals related to our average net income over the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_3_2023_To_1_3_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_KRtHCTK-K02DrrF0sMtznw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_z0oS0PpzzEWgZma5eNhbvQ">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> period of fiscal years 2023-2025. Participants will have the ability to earn between <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_3_2023_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_NqmaUP0pDEis_csTWCbcrg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfTargetNumberOfSharesToBeEarned" scale="-2" id="Narr_kbmAjxwLeEqFfc6840Vsvg">50</ix:nonFraction>% of the target number of the PSUs &#8211; NI for achieving threshold performance and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_3_2023_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_nqU5yacuN0CHSOs9ceQ_Ng" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfTargetNumberOfSharesToBeEarned" scale="-2" id="Narr_6OaeT-nmoEa2ra4BTxhSpg">200</ix:nonFraction>% of the target number of the PSUs &#8211; NI for achieving maximum performance. The grant date fair value of the PSUs &#8211; NI was based on the closing sales price of our common stock on grant date, which was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_cK0tCHROTEui2Cyp4lJA6w" contextRef="As_Of_1_3_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_3PmJxYhzW06_SL4V6ao6Ag" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_i7QC8SvAXUSHgSk8iMC0jw">26.38</ix:nonFraction> per PSU.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:11pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">On January 3, 2023, the Compensation Committee also granted a total target number of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_sbIDFd6ia024cAvXthIBHQ" contextRef="Duration_1_3_2023_To_1_3_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_KQHHya8fVE6wYO35AEkaKw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_ceEa42DC402uyoju5vR9Og">41,126</ix:nonFraction> PSUs to our executive officers designated as &#8220;PSU &#8211; FCF&#8221;. These PSUs were weighted as approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_3_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_lnybq57wJ026t5Mm_W96_A" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_z_n1SNA_hUSv3wk2R7M2MA">35</ix:nonFraction>% of the overall 2023 executive long-term incentive compensation arrangement and will vest and be paid based upon the achievement of pre-established goals related to our average free cash flow over the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_3_2023_To_1_3_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_KQHHya8fVE6wYO35AEkaKw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_Y7W8vAeHsU6smwra0SiwrA">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> period of fiscal years 2023-2025. Participants will have the ability to earn between <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_1_3_2023_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PerformanceSharesRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_Sr_6hAhIlkKKsN9YRPv4Dg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfTargetNumberOfSharesToBeEarned" scale="-2" id="Narr_Jv1OQuMXq0264TZgy