"Narr_WXujuw_IQkmCHBfeC3FtOg">2.7</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> million, respectively, of stock&#8211;based compensation expense related to grants under the 2016 Equity Plan. As of October 31, 2025, there was an estimated </span><span style="font-size:11pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_-q6KwND1tUyIErqFk9amwg" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2025_Ddj8avuNXUekqecrPRoVuw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognized" scale="6" id="Narr_1kwbVK_K3UyjeDPzGqjhBQ">2.4</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> million of total unrecognized stock&#8211;based compensation cost that we expect to recognize by the end of the first quarter of fiscal year 2028.</span></p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="_ba66ae7d_e3b8_4acd_83bf_1543e86f9b35"></a><a id="Tc_czCsXP08r02f3rj-pm4wRw_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_wXY4wOVg10e8CH10Hdxgow_1_5"></a><a id="Tc__U_31rSNs0eXtXHa5TpFFg_1_8"></a><a id="Tc_5MyWg5zDnkOGaOuKuRFG6w_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_8p7Xoyk-O0aC4B6xG7nf0Q_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_AcX6Kr1CGEeyHRdRkBV1Pw_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_7350Eg0m1kywwXPIA6xK1g_2_8"></a><a id="Tc_sl_x9IkE7Ui1rTxNyH9u4w_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_9DrssJxFaE2-YSMz84Mk1w_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_DJWXOl_KAEmAqbDaHIqCAg_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_4gS8BRpObE2i6MihVDy_Mg_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_TqE30IdAGU-qdxay7IugRQ_7_2"></a><a id="Tc_q82YF08mr0i__oZtqTtgwg_7_5"></a><a id="Tc_fcxHfCXT0EuvxcoYJPnqBg_7_8"></a><a id="Tc_pH1BfUrz_U-I3cDdV1-74A_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_mTI4WaNqNEOua93lqmeU0g_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_eAMRx_Bclka72zp4OeU8FQ_10_0"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_11_1_2024_To_10_31_2025_yHj0kCho6kqyjsmbpqPtIg" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionsDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_b2-e-9ki7U-II-Rh6VMc8A" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;">9.</b><span style="font-size:11pt;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><b style="font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;">RELATED PARTY TRANSACTIONS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;">As of October 31, 2025, we owned approximately </span><span style="font-size:11pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_jj0rcDZiOUCx-E1zbbIpaA" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_hurc_HurcoAutomationLtdMember_BNhX2vELpU-Yed0vdFdMJw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_ybGSI9bl2kKjnfQOaHUJGQ">35</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> of the outstanding shares of a Taiwanese&#8211;based contract manufacturer, Hurco Automation,&#160;Ltd. (&#8220;HAL&#8221;). HAL&#8217;s scope of activities includes the design, manufacture, sales, and distribution of industrial automation products, software systems, and related components, including control systems and components produced under contract for sale exclusively to us. We are accounting for this investment using the equity method. The investment of </span><span style="font-size:11pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_-q6KwND1tUyIErqFk9amwg" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_hurc_HurcoAutomationLtdMember_BNhX2vELpU-Yed0vdFdMJw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestments" scale="6" id="Narr_eg9cjX_u9kqCQKquLAyXRw">5.5</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> million and </span><span style="font-size:11pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_-q6KwND1tUyIErqFk9amwg" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_hurc_HurcoAutomationLtdMember_9YR1jDg8YUCbKAxb69So2w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestments" scale="6" id="Narr_XaTILRL6xEuy0uTdXGX6tQ">5.3</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> million as of October 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively, is included in Investments and other assets, net on the Consolidated Balance Sheets. Purchases of control systems and components from HAL amounted to </span><span style="font-size:11pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_-q6KwND1tUyIErqFk9amwg" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2024_To_10_31_2025_us-gaap_EquityMethodInvestmentNonconsolidatedInvesteeAxis_hurc_HurcoAutomationLtdMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_xvzWl6T4EkiJyeeP0tmBZQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionPurchasesFromRelatedParty" scale="6" id="Narr_JlQeQfR1bUKqBY36nOmlxw">6.1</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> million, </span><span style="font-size:11pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_-q6KwND1tUyIErqFk9amwg" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2023_To_10_31_2024_us-gaap_EquityMethodInvestmentNonconsolidatedInvesteeAxis_hurc_HurcoAutomationLtdMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_M654KpBqnkOiTqNmwR8QjQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionPurchasesFromRelatedParty" scale="6" id="Narr_jB5SuGUdvE2SMdXNU1uaug">6.6</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> million, and </span><span style="font-size:11pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_-q6KwND1tUyIErqFk9amwg" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2022_To_10_31_2023_us-gaap_EquityMethodInvestmentNonconsolidatedInvesteeAxis_hurc_HurcoAutomationLtdMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_30R9KESnvUGWBVA9ZyndvA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionPurchasesFromRelatedParty" scale="6" id="Narr_JiZZGeiCdkiHPShpT-BAMg">10.2</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> million in fiscal years 2025, 2024, and 2023, respectively. Sales of control component parts to HAL were less than </span><span style="font-size:11pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_-q6KwND1tUyIErqFk9amwg" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2024_To_10_31_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_EquityMethodInvestmentNonconsolidatedInvesteeAxis_hurc_HurcoAutomationLtdMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_eyETRB2tw0mxx9yzEw-bfg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Revenues" scale="6" id="Narr_9FhuFFGJMEm3o2r0Bb-8PQ">0.1</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> million for each of the fiscal&#160;years ended October 31, 2025, 2024, and 2023. Trade payables to HAL were </span><span style="font-size:11pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_-q6KwND1tUyIErqFk9amwg" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2025_us-gaap_EquityMethodInvestmentNonconsolidatedInvesteeAxis_hurc_HurcoAutomationLtdMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_YKmelggb6kaQSlVXJ3XsLA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AccountsPayableCurrent" scale="6" id="Narr_X8f9-NClMkqhxbNG6GYysQ">1.2</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt;"> million and </span><span style="font-size:11pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_-q6KwND1tUyIErqFk9amwg" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2024_us-gaap_EquityMethodInvestmentNonconsolidatedInvesteeAxis_hurc_HurcoAutomationLtdMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_8HcmZAVi-ES1BfTb_p-Yjg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AccountsPayableCurrent" scale="6" id="Narr_btwUoJgHr0e2Z2BZc9w_ig">0.7</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:11pt